  "description": "As with most classic preparations, fish stock comes with lots of rules. We put them to the test to see which matter and which don't. This recipe is the result, and it couldn't be easier.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 1 hr 45 min.\n\nNotes: Soaking and washing the fish bones and heads helps create a more delicate stock, but don't drive yourself crazy. Our tests showed that removing blood has a subtle effect—enough to make it worth doing, but not worth being obsessive about.",
